<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus May CPI falls 0.75 pct mnth/mnth.</title>
<headline>Cyprus May CPI falls 0.75 pct mnth/mnth.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus's consumer price index dropped by 0.75 percent month-on-month in May to 119.64 points from 120.55 in April, the statistics and research department said.</p>
<p>    Consumer price index	May 97   April 97   May 96</p>
<p>    Month/month change (pct)  -0.75     0.90	 0.30</p>
<p>    Year/year change (pct)     3.07     4.17	 3.23</p>
<p>    Index (92=100)	     119.64   120.55     116.07</p>
<p>A drop in the prices of motor cars and fresh vegetables was noted during the month, while the price of potatoes and certain fresh fruit rose, the department said.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
